{"id":"8c1d1dfe384e3df3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryType.md","title":"CurryType","display":"CurryType","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CurryType","parameters":["g","t","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CurryType"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>独立的 Curry 简单类型指派规则；抽象参数类型不由检查器定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CurryType g t a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1751 (@ CurryTypeProof g t a z1751))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"714a9f72af00287c\" href=\"?note=714a9f72af00287c\" title=\"ZFC_CurryTypeProof\">CurryTypeProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CurryType g t a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CurryTypeProof","status":"resolved","id":"714a9f72af00287c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CurryTypeProof|CurryTypeProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":805,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryType|CurryType]]"},{"id":"0a4030559fddef47","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_CurryAccept|CurryAccept]]；[[ZFC_CurryType|CurryType]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-510","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_CurryType|CurryType]]"},{"id":"f3184cdad9eb6fab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryType|CurryType]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","714a9f72af00287c","593f9bdab4d60707"]}